WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.862
People see the name and description of a workspace in the workspace list and in the

1.2
00:00:05.862 --> 00:00:10.189
workspace picker on encounters. Step 1. Open the workspace list.

1.3
00:00:10.189 --> 00:00:14.611
In the facility sidebar, select Settings, then Workspaces.

2.1
00:00:14.611 --> 00:00:20.881
Step 2. Open the workspace. To find it by name, type part of its name in Search.

2.2
00:00:20.881 --> 00:00:25.219
Then select the workspace name, or Edit in its row.

3.1
00:00:25.219 --> 00:00:28.659
Step 3. Change the name or the description.

3.2
00:00:28.659 --> 00:00:33.853
Open General settings and change one or both fields. Name is required.

3.3
00:00:33.853 --> 00:00:36.133
Description is optional.

4.1
00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:41.827
Step 4. Save the change. Select Save Changes. Care shows Workspace updated,

4.2
00:00:41.827 --> 00:00:46.537
and the workspace list shows the new name and description.
